## 3. Optimized Bubble Sort (Stops Early)

```python
nums = list(map(int, input("Enter numbers: ").split()))

n = len(nums)

for i in range(n):
    swapped = False

    for j in range(n - i - 1):
        if nums[j] > nums[j + 1]:
            nums[j], nums[j + 1] = nums[j + 1], nums[j]
            swapped = True

    if not swapped:
        break

print("Sorted Array:", nums)
```
